  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang-yizhi-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang-yizhi-family:p001:m0000" ref="c25_57d_8e6">禕之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang-yizhi-family:p001:m0003" ref="c25_57d_8e6">文劭</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang-yizhi-family:p001:m0006" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAA">述</persName>次子。少知名，尚尋陽公主。仕至中書郎，未三十而卒。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang-yizhi-family:p001:m0032" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">坦之</persName>悼念，與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang-yizhi-family:p001:m0038" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>稱之，贈散騎常侍。</p>
</text>
